  "question": "Let $$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$$ Verify that $3(A+B)=3A+3B$.",
